// src/v4/extdeps/languages/javascript.dag
// Scope: JavaScript ECMA-262 ES2025 LanguageModel — scalar fact-bundles, inhabitants, bidirectional grammar data.
// Owns: JsScalar, JsNonIntegerScalar, JsIntegerPrimitiveFacts, JsFloatPrimitiveFacts, JsNonIntegerPrimitiveFacts, JsLanguageModel, js_*_facts, js_*_inhabitant_node, js_declared_inhabitants_root, js_mvp1_target_model, js_mvp1_* grammar/lex.
// Consumes: v4.compiler.parse, v4.compiler.tokenize, v4.std.collection, v4.std.node, v4.std.logic, v4.std.algebra, v4.std.text, v4.std.model_core, v4.std.target_model.
// Status: T-4 javascript slice — ECMA-262 primitives (Number/BigInt/String/Boolean/Undefined/Null/Symbol); `core: ModelCore` primitives + surface-symbol membership from `js_*_facts_catalog` via fold; canonical_symbols = catalog surface spellings + MVP lex/grammar; MVP-1 grammar/token substrate for T-10 (literal Node round-trip still 🟡); bool canonical-B decl-ref — 🟡 E-6(b) staging.
// Anchor: https://tc39.es/ecma262/2025/multipage/

